 "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["### Global Metadata\nA 30-second Mandarin Synth-Pop and City Pop miniature with a brisk 4/4 dance groove around 120 BPM. Combine nostalgic neon-lit atmosphere with polished modern production using arpeggiated synthesizers, warm analog pads, melodic electric bass, crisp electronic drums, electric piano, muted funk guitar, and sparkling bell tones. The emotional arc should move naturally from quiet anticipation into confidence, release, and a warm final resolution. Keep every section concise so the complete structure finishes within exactly 60 seconds.\n\n### Vocal Details\nIt was performed by a male singer, and the singer had a clear, youthful baritone voice with a light and transparent quality.Use natural melodic singing with precise diction and compact phrasing. Keep the Verse intimate, let the Pre-Chorus gradually rise, and deliver the Chorus with brighter projection and greater emotional openness. Pull the vocal slightly closer and softer during the Bridge, then sing the Outro warmly with a short controlled sustain on the final syllable. Add restrained double-tracked harmony only in the Chorus. Avoid excessive melisma, long vocal runs, spoken narration, or additional lyrics.\n\n### Arrangement\nThe Intro is an extremely short instrumental pickup featuring a filtered synth arpeggio and one reversed electronic accent. Enter the Verse immediately with electric bass, restrained drums, warm electric piano, and muted funk guitar. In the Pre-Chorus, reduce the kick briefly while the synth pad and rising arpeggio increase tension.\n\nOpen the Chorus with the full dance-pop groove, layered claps, brighter synth chords, active bass, and a compact lead-synth countermelody. Strip the percussion back during the Bridge, leaving bass pulse, pad, and a dry central vocal. The Instrumental section should be only a brief melodic response played by the lead synth over the continuing groove, not a solo or extended interlude.\n\nFor the Outro, remove the heavy drums and retain electric piano, warm pad, and a soft bass resolution beneath the final vocal phrase. Finish with one clean synth-and-drum closing hit. Do not repeat any section or generate additional lyrics. End sharply at exactly 30 seconds without a fade."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [591.2939453125, 505.94488525390625], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 3}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [2], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["minimax_music3_dit_fp32.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [480, 90], "pos": [0, 923.7403564453125], "id": 3, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"name": "minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.31.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [9, 10], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [1043316219551007, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_n