 the final syllable. Add restrained double-tracked harmony only in the Chorus. Avoid excessive melisma, long vocal runs, spoken narration, or additional lyrics.\n\n### Arrangement\nThe Intro is an extremely short instrumental pickup featuring a filtered synth arpeggio and one reversed electronic accent. Enter the Verse immediately with electric bass, restrained drums, warm electric piano, and muted funk guitar. In the Pre-Chorus, reduce the kick briefly while the synth pad and rising arpeggio increase tension.\n\nOpen the Chorus with the full dance-pop groove, layered claps, brighter synth chords, active bass, and a compact lead-synth countermelody. Strip the percussion back during the Bridge, leaving bass pulse, pad, and a dry central vocal. The Instrumental section should be only a brief melodic response played by the lead synth over the continuing groove, not a solo or extended interlude.\n\nFor the Outro, remove the heavy drums and retain electric piano, warm pad, and a soft bass resolution beneath the final vocal phrase. Finish with one clean synth-and-drum closing hit. Do not repeat any section or generate additional lyrics. End sharply at exactly 59 seconds without a fade.", "[Intro]\n\n[Verse]\n旧照片反复擦了几遍\n相片里的你，笑得比如今少年\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n回忆像一班总晚点的列车\n尚未驶远，你仍坐在我身侧\n\n[Chorus]\n门前樱桃树，又缀上新果一串\n纵然岁月催我老去，春光依旧赴约而来\n\n[Bridge]\n你推开窗，轻声说今晚的风好甜\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n", 222, "fixed", 60.000000000000014, 1.5, 60], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 14, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 9, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "link": 19, "label": "max_duration", "type": "F